(7417368, 1170174, 16148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones and composition in this warm and tender image.  Your choice of using a canvas texture works well for the challenge.  That being said, I do prefer pure photographs.  This painterly photograph processing exercise cheapens an image IMO.  I''d love to see this presented as a photograph.  My top pick!</td>', 'Beautiful tones and composition in this warm and tender image.  Your choice of using a canvas texture works well for the challenge.  That being said, I do prefer pure photographs.  This painterly photograph processing exercise cheapens an image IMO.  I''d love to see this presented as a photograph.  My top pick!', '2015-11-19 11:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7417369, 1170083, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice restraint in processing.  Lovely portrait dabbled in light.</td>', 'Nice restraint in processing.  Lovely portrait dabbled in light.', '2015-11-19 11:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
