(7418403, 1170279, 50695, '<td valign="top">sorry, but this is all photography. you have brought a photograph to a photography challenge. the perspective of the chair and pillar tucked in the corner is more daring than di chirico... a product of the photographic mind. the light is the relentless light of the photograph... high highlights, vast areas with texture but no shading. if this is painted, it''s painted with a roller, not a brush. I might not have noticed this in a normal challenge, but in a painting challenge it is a defiant, brutal paean to the photograph.<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'sorry, but this is all photography. you have brought a photograph to a photography challenge. the perspective of the chair and pillar tucked in the corner is more daring than di chirico... a product of the photographic mind. the light is the relentless light of the photograph... high highlights, vast areas with texture but no shading. if this is painted, it''s painted with a roller, not a brush. I might not have noticed this in a normal challenge, but in a painting challenge it is a defiant, brutal paean to the photograph. I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery  ', '2015-11-24 22:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7418404, 1170308, 50695, '<td valign="top">and a beautiful painting it is<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'and a beautiful painting it is I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery  ', '2015-11-24 22:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
